<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84552" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλᾰχ-οῦ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in many places,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὔνομα γένοιτ᾽ ἂν πολλαχοῦ, τὸ σῶμα
					δ᾽ οὔ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					588
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				209e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοῦ πολλάκις ἀκηκόατε πολλαχοῦ
					λέγοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					31c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐν τοῖς λόγοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					329c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὅμηρος π. λέγει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					408a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἄλλοθι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.1.30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς γῆς</span>
			v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				111a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαχῇ</span>
			, <i>on many grounds,</i> interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.122
			</span></i>, v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.183
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
